#{{AIHEADER}}:1
TYPE="path_rules"
GLOB="src/**"

LANGUAGE_RUNTIME:
- C# 12 / .NET 8 LTS (fill in exact SDK version in global.json)
- Nullable reference types enabled — no #nullable disable without comment

BUILD:
- dotnet build
- dotnet format --verify-no-changes
- dotnet build /warnaserror for CI

STYLE_CONVENTIONS:
- dotnet format enforced — do not hand-format
- Roslyn analyzer warnings as errors in CI (fill in ruleset)
- Prefer records over classes for immutable data
- Primary constructors for simple dependency injection (C# 12)
- async/await throughout — no .Result or .Wait() blocking calls

FORBIDDEN_PATTERNS:
- No .Result or .Wait() on Tasks — always await
- No Console.WriteLine() in production paths — use ILogger
- No hardcoded connection strings or secrets in source
- No suppression of nullable warnings without a comment

EXPLICITLY_NOT_TOUCHING:
- (fill in: auto-generated EF migrations in flight, scaffolded code, etc.)
